# WCAG 2.1 AA Compliance

All web styling and design changes MUST meet WCAG 2.1 Level AA. Failing contrast = blocker.

## Minimum ratios

| Element | Minimum |
|---------|---------|
| Normal text | 4.5:1 |
| Large text (≥18pt bold / ≥24px) | 3:1 |
| UI components & boundaries | 3:1 |

## Pre-ship checklist

0. **Theme sandbox** — validate color pairs in `theme-sandbox/` at `http://localhost:3333` before porting to production (see `zoo-theme-sandbox`)
1. Text on background — every pair passes
2. Link colors — all states pass
3. Button text — both states pass
4. Form inputs — border ≥3:1; focus ring ≥3:1
5. Placeholder text ≥4.5:1 or use labels
6. Focus indicators on all interactive elements
7. Dark mode variants pass too
8. `prefers-reduced-motion: reduce` disables non-essential animations
9. No color-only information (use icons/text/underline)

## Button standard

| Type | Background | Text |
|------|------------|------|
| Primary | Dark brand | White |
| Secondary | Transparent | Body text |
| Ghost | Transparent | Brand-text |

Define both `--color-brand` (decorative) and `--color-brand-text` (text-safe) tokens.
